    "created_at": "2020-03-04T04:45:29Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-04T04:45:29Z",
    "body": "Yep, turns out it's user error. At some point in the distant past, I installed https://github.com/rupa/z and forgot about it. It's responsible for the jobs.\r\n\r\n(BTW I figured this out by hacking the starship_precmd to output the jobs to a file, and then compared that to the functions defined in `set`.)",
