    "body": "I didn't know that `z` did that. (I guess because I mostly use it on zsh).\r\n\r\nIs there a way for you to fix this (e.g. changing order of function evaluation for `PROMPT_COMMAND`)? If so, we'd love to know in case someone else has this issue.",
