    "updated_at": "2020-07-02T06:39:19Z",
    "body": "I found this issue because I have the same problem. Having learned that z.sh is the culprit I experimented by editing my bashrc and moving the line that loads z.sh to below the line that loads starship. This fixed the issue for me.\r\n",
